    "Description": "A transparency slide showing the left side detail of a carousel pig’s saddle. The pig is colored a reddish orange in some parts and a light tan in others. The saddle is brown with a lighter brown and yellow saddle blanket and the tack is green, yellow and red. The pig is very well worn, with much of the paint missing. The reddish orange may be an undercoat of paint. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK 16a left middle” at the top and “Pig RALEIGH WAKE CO RR 6-79 RALEIGH FINE ARTS SOCIETY” at the bottom.",
